1
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,290
As expected, the core stops every three breaths.

2
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,480
Now is the time.

3
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,400
Chijiu.

4
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,300
Uncle Zhou.

5
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:05,360
The Yang-gathering thread is about to break.

6
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,960
Qinghe, you need to speed up.

7
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:40,160
My legs.

8
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,039
I can feel them.

9
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,160
The evil spirit has been eliminated.

10
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:50,090
The injuries caused by the Yin spirit will heal soon.

11
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,479
Good.

12
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:53,720
Good.

13
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,130
You've all worked hard.

14
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,320
Stay for a family dinner tonight.

15
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:03,320
Qinghe.

16
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:05,040
Words cannot express my gratitude.

17
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,400
Three generations of the Ma family

18
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,200
owe you a life.

19
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,520
You're too polite, Uncle Ma.

20
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,720
I just took away what shouldn't be here.

21
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:15,840
Senior Brother.

22
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,700
I remember this is your favorite.

23
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,720
Before my grandfather passed away, he said,

24
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,680
if a successor of the Yanshi Yang technique comes to the Ma family,

25
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,880
give him this Zhen trigram copper coin.

26
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,960
I've guarded it for thirty years,

27
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,960
never understanding what it meant,

28
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,240
until today.

29
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,770
Grandfather also said,

30
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,380
the trigram coin is a lock,

31
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,160
and the key is in the successor's hands.

32
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,560
As for what it locks,

33
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,380
he didn't have time to say.

34
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,970
Thank you, Uncle Ma.

35
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,720
Down after two cups.

36
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:56,850
No progress at all after so many years.

37
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,440
Still the same.

38
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:26,410
Senior Brother is already asleep.

39
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,000
He must be exhausted.

40
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,600
He usually carries everything himself.

41
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:33,400
I didn't expect his alcohol tolerance to be so low.

42
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,680
Let's go.

43
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,960
Senior Brother was very clingy when he was a child.

44
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,880
The first time he made the spiritual pivot for the wooden armor guard,

45
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,600
he could never match the breathing rhythm,

46
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,260
and cried out of frustration.

47
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,960
Uncle Xuanchen sat right next to him,

48
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,240
teaching him hand in hand,

49
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,570
for three whole months.

50
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,400
I really couldn't tell

51
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,600
that he would cry too.

52
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:56,240
After Uncle Xuanchen disappeared,

53
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,360
he stopped crying,

54
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,760
and rarely smiled.

55
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,160
He was only twelve that year,

56
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:04,060
and changed into a different person overnight.

57
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,040
I understand.

58
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,880
After my teacher disappeared,

59
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:10,010
I didn't cry in front of others either.

60
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,840
I always felt that crying meant admitting defeat.

61
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:13,800
In the end,

62
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,240
it was Qinghe who helped me find him.

63
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,000
He will seek justice for your teacher,

64
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,760
and he will also rescue Uncle Xuanchen.

65
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:23,220
I know he definitely will.

66
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,560
I'm just afraid

67
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:27,020
that he'll carry it all by himself again.

68
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:29,810
Then let's not let him carry it all by himself.

69
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,480
Qinghe.

70
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,800
A few years ago,

71
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:37,980
a disciple of the Ma family saw your master in Jiangnan.

72
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,720
If you are going to Jiangnan,

73
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:43,140
help me bring something to the old lady of the Lu family.

74
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,080
Why did you come out too?

75
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:56,720
It's getting dark.

76
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,920
It's not safe for you to be out alone.

77
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,400
From the posthouse to the head of Tongji Bridge,

78
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:03,800
it's only a little over two hundred meters.

79
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:06,560
You're collecting materials for the county examination again.

80
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,240
Just now, an old woman was sitting by the river,

81
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,900
telling stories to children.

82
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,920
In the past,

83
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,920
when the river flooded during the rainy season,

84
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,280
people died every year.

85
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,600
Later, an old stonemason and his apprentice

86
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,800
quarried whole blocks of stone from the mountain

87
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,460
and built this Tongji Bridge.

88
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,880
That old stonemason was likely well-versed in Luban's techniques.

89
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:27,080
The bridge's location, orientation, and the curvature of its arches

90
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:29,240
were all designed to guide the water flow.

91
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,160
The dimensions of this single-arch bridge

92
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,240
happen to fall on the 'Yi' position of the Luban ruler,

93
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,840
which governs smooth travel

94
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:35,940
and saving people.

95
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,800
Only when talking about architecture and construction

96
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,330
do you become so talkative.

97
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,560
That day at the Tang family's house,

98
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,920
you talked about the structure of the dovetail groove

99
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,180
for nearly four hours.

100
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,920
It was Xiaotang who kept asking questions.

101
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,280
If I didn't explain it thoroughly,

102
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,640
she would make mistakes when doing it herself.

103
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:50,360
My treatise is almost finished.

104
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,159
There is someone in the acknowledgments.

105
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,280
Guess who it is?

106
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:02,720
It truly is the Lu family's garden in Jiangnan,

107
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,580
exuding a scholarly atmosphere.

108
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,380
Thank you for your hard work, young friends.

109
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,240
Old Mrs. Lu.

110
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,720
Old Mrs. Ma asked me to bring this to you.

111
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:18,020
It's kind of her to still remember me.

112
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:22,160
There have been too many family matters these past few years,

113
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:24,090
so I haven't been able to visit her.

114
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:26,680
Big sister,

115
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:27,690
have some candy.

116
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,280
Thank you.

117
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,560
Keep it for yourself.

118
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:32,800
Forgive my presumption,

119
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,120
but this child...

120
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:39,720
The Lu family's children were originally all smart,

121
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:43,600
but in the past two years, they've become increasingly slow.

122
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,680
The youngest one was born like this.

123
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:49,960
The Lu family has produced scholars and architects for generations.

124
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,200
When I was lazy as a child,

125
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:54,200
my father always used the Lu family's older siblings to lecture me.

126
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:55,000
Hiss.

127
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,440
Could it be...

128
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,370
the Bookworm Curse?

129
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,720
What's wrong?

130
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,920
This house is too quiet.

131
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:25,240
It doesn't seem like anyone lives here.

132
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,200
I'll go look around.

133
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,900
Three generations of the Lu family grew up here.

134
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:35,120
The courtyard used to be filled with the sound of reading,

135
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:37,000
but now you can't hear a single sound.

136
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,159
Since when?

137
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,040
Six years ago,

138
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:46,450
the day my eldest granddaughter entered the upper house of the Academy of Rites and Customs.

139
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:52,760
Yanshi dark arts.

140
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:54,490
It's the Mohists again.

141
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:57,920
This edition should have over seventy annotations from later generations,

142
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,780
but now there are only three left.

143
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:13,120
The Mohists carved dark talismans into the bookworms,

144
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,980
making them consume the Lu family's literary aura.

145
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:18,320
What will the Bookworm Curse do to people?

146
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:19,720
It consumes spirituality.

147
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,720
It doesn't hurt when it attaches to you,

148
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,480
but your memory,

149
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,080
judgment,

150
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:23,840
and sanity...
